GIMP Palette
Name: Tokyo Night Mix
#
# Tokyo Night Mix for Xournal++: one palette for all papers (white, light,
# dark, black). Per-hue pick of the Night/Light rendition with the best
# worst-case contrast across those four papers (3:1+ = pen-safe).
# Sources: enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme README Night + Light tables.
# The two ink extremes pair up like default's Black/White: dark ink for
# light papers, light ink for dark papers. Mid-grey paper defeats every
# chromatic ink, so it is excluded from the guarantee.
# Install: ~/.config/xournalpp/palettes/, then
#   Edit -> Preferences -> Palette -> Tokyo Night Mix (restart if missing).
26 27 38 Ink Dark
108 110 117 Grey
140 67 81 Red
150 80 39 Orange
143 94 21 Yellow
56 95 13 Green
51 99 92 Teal
0 108 134 Cyan
41 89 170 Blue
90 62 142 Magenta
192 202 245 Ink Light
